 remake. She is a bright foreign exchange student with a captivating figure that has a playful happy-go-lucky type of personality. She instantly took a fancy to Takuya once she met him in his new form, which she believes to be a ninja's work. She will try her best in order to seduce him (her)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33937"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2ec0fd89b4e176691700613ffc92425447ab38986ba5ef61c421a284b338fd9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/09de48ab2b56bf4d585fd9053e1488dcee35435cbfe478e53b6116329c4010ce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"萌木 唯","creatorId":"vndb:s61","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s61","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s61","name":"永瀬 いくみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:541","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c34009","characterName":"相原 拓也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c34009"},"originalCharacterName":"相原 拓也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"161"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"As a girl, everything changes for Takuya. (S)he's suddenly the center of attention; it seems every man around wants a date! As a guy, Takuya may had been just a simple wimp. However, as a girl he, or she, has a perfect body and everyone seems to be noticing it. How will Takuya react to the newfound popularity? Of course, he's curious about sex, but how far can he take it? Will he find a way to change back into a man? Will he want to at the very end?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c34009"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/3508c355387b755ee46138223e633635b1a92089f6735df8795901ef90b8ecc3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf9d5127273b50a62d1f9001959956a294391caa7f43732ad767bc06a66cbcf8.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"上戸 琉","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s263","name":"儀武 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:542","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63617","characterName":"宮村 浩","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63617"},"originalCharacterName":"宮村 浩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hiroshi is an art teacher at Takuya's high school. He's a nice guy and gets along very well with all the students. Therefore, it's not surprising that he's very sympathetic to Takuya's new awkward situation, and he will do everything that's necessary in order to make Takuya comfortable in his new skin."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63617"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/51c0ac1510a0b61a30b7cb6027b96d550eb0a2f8cfed11765874e454e8b582f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fa29eb360288941e1c914c97dce580312b5179d2c81ba413427edd09c6e39b1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"坂野 茂","creatorId":"vndb:s3139","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3139","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3139","name":"坂野茂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:547","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63619","characterName":"寺田","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63619"},"originalCharacterName":"寺田","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Terada is the gym teacher at Miyanomori Junior College. Takuya, being a weakling that he is, has always drawn his disdain. Perhaps the coach will be more forgiving now that Takuya's a girl... or maybe not."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63619"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4b6b5dea11b979e3012b593e63c924eb1967c925e1b9b52d47fa3a5a635805b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c8/c8b13b185325ce1ac218ea762ca7e19ca5c3e9ec0aac7088e02bf0af66c19ffa.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63620","characterName":"片桐 明日香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63620"},"originalCharacterName":"片桐 明日香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asuka is a childhood friend of Takuya. Ever since they were kids, she has always looked out for him. Naturally, she's uneasy about Takuya's new form, but she continues to support him through his ordeal. With her tough facade, it's hard to tell how she really feels about the situation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63620"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04bb64149f8e1b88e2314696e09fa7b558aaa2f15c7492ea38f5916c166e7b21.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e63903980abb54dbc77ab6093c8dfaaff4d8f1adff44c4502efd500191a5bbb.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"涼森 ちさと","creatorId":"vndb:s445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s445","name":"すずき けいこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:543","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63621","characterName":"工藤 弘二","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63621"},"originalCharacterName":"工藤 弘二","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kouji's a shy schoolmate from Takuya's high school. While most other guys have only acknowledged Takuya's new attributes, Kouji on the other hand has fallen fully head over heels in love with \"her\". That fervent feeling of love will make Kouji gather enough courage so that he can send a love letter to Takuya, in hopes of seducing the object of his most passionate desires. Will his confession be answered with the same kind of feelings by Takuya?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63621"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad7a23964570440ddc0a265827523151de9743f6c0d9cf2a8cb1d9cd0a7a38fe.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fb876a1573dfd8d89f80047a3e810f74f182ff5d24a61fe7e2a23a316f71bf2.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63623","characterName":"佐藤 麻美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63623"},"originalCharacterName":"佐藤 麻美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Asami is the student club president of the Miyanomori High School's chemistry club, of which Takuya is the only other member. She may be smart, but she's a little bit of an eccentric, often using Takuya as a test subject for her experiments. What role did she play in his most recent trouble? More importantly, will she be able to help him sort out this new problem?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63623"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb67168b28c6a4fd07b68b6a403761eb27c29dd827156216f8ed96a9b1a1ce57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1f82b502216763311345b0500c2af7ccba23c9746caad9fceb62f9052c65c47.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"関 和美","creatorId":"vndb:s1314","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1314","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1314","name":"小倉 文江","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:545","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63624","characterName":"相原 夏美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63624"},"originalCharacterName":"相原 夏美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Natsumi is Takuya's spiteful step-sister. She's older and up until now has pretty much ignored her step-sibling. However, after the change, Natsumi will take a very perverse delight in torturing her new \"sister\". Natsumi's boyfriend, Seiji, might also find the new Takuya interesting. With such peculiar people interested in him, Takuya's time as a female will likely (not) be as fun as he hopes it to be."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63624"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e5002ffa0c1a4d8caf3cd5741f034b493b10d352740fdfbde27034902224e91b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/44576613d013b3c4e3d61e1874b3494b3cd929953ce1dce510d39c4521da688a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"なかせ ひな","creatorId":"vndb:s926","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s926","name":"なかせ ひな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:544","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p36","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:93","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p36","name":"CROWD","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:96: